# 🌐 Static IP Configuration

## 🎯 Objective

To configure a network using **static IP addresses** and verify communication between multiple PCs through switches and a router.

## 🛠️ Tools Used

- Cisco Packet Tracer
- Cisco Router
- Cisco 2960 Switches
- PCs

## 📚 Topics Covered

- Static IP Addressing
- IPv4 Address Configuration
- Default Gateway
- Switch Connectivity
- Router Connectivity
- Network Communication

