## 🔧 Configuration

Static IP addresses were manually assigned to the PCs in the network.

The router was configured with the IP address:

`123.1.0.254`

The PCs were connected through multiple Cisco 2960 switches.

## ✅ Result

Successfully configured static IP addresses for the connected devices and verified network connectivity between the PCs.

